---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Refund & Cancellation Policy | BRNDNUR Advisory LLP";
const description = "Refund and Cancellation Policy for BRNDNUR Advisory LLP. Details regarding statutory fees, advisory disbursements, and cancellation procedures.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/refund-cancellation-policy/";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/refund-cancellation-policy/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Hero -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="bn-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">Refund & Cancellation Policy</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal & Compliance</p>
        <h1>Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
        <p class="lead">Clear guidelines regarding service cancellations, professional fee adjustments, and statutory government disbursements.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
            <span>Government Statutory Fees Non-Refundable</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            <span>7 to 10 Working Days Processing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
            <span>Manjeri, Malappuram, Kerala</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Policy Content -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <article class="legal-prose" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;">
          <div class="advisory-notice" style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 32px;">
            <div class="advisory-notice-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="advisory-notice-content">
              <h4>Effective Date: October 2026</h4>
              <p>This policy governs cancellations and refund inquiries for advisory services provided by BRNDNUR Advisory LLP.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2>1. Overview of Service Structure</h2>
          <p>BRNDNUR Advisory LLP provides customized intellectual property, commercial compliance, and corporate advisory services. Engagements typically involve two distinct cost components:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Statutory Government Fees:</strong> Mandatory fees paid directly to official government bodies (such as the Trade Marks Registry / CGPDTM, Ministry of Corporate Affairs, or FSSAI).</li>
            <li><strong>Professional Advisory Fees:</strong> Fees for clearance search analysis, documentation assembly, filing coordination, and advisory consultations.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>2. Statutory Government Fees Are Non-Refundable</h2>
          <p>Once a statutory government fee has been disbursed to the official government portal and a government challan or filing receipt has been generated, that statutory fee is strictly non-refundable under all circumstances, as government portals do not remit paid filing fees back to applicants.</p>

          <h2>3. Cancellation Prior to Application Filing</h2>
          <p>If a client requests service cancellation in writing before documentation has been submitted to the official government portal:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Any unexpended statutory government fees collected on behalf of the client will be refunded in full.</li>
            <li>Professional advisory fees will be assessed based on the work already completed (e.g., preliminary clearance searching, document drafting, or advisory sessions conducted). The balance of unearned advisory fees, if any, will be refunded.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>4. Cancellation Post-Filing</h2>
          <p>Once an application (such as Form TM-A for trademarks, GST registration, Udyam MSME, or FSSAI filing) has been officially submitted and acknowledged by the statutory portal, professional advisory fees for the filing phase are deemed fully earned and are non-refundable.</p>

          <h2>5. Unforeseen Registry Actions and Oppositions</h2>
          <p>Government examination objections, third-party trademark oppositions, and official hearing notices are independent statutory events resulting from registry review or third-party claims. Such events do not constitute service deficiency on the part of BRNDNUR and do not entitle the applicant to a refund of filing fees.</p>

          <h2>6. Refund Processing Method</h2>
          <p>Approved refunds are processed via original payment methods (direct bank transfer or UPI) within 7 to 10 working days following written confirmation and verification of bank account details.</p>

          <h2>7. Contact for Cancellation Inquiries</h2>
          <div class="legal-box" style="margin-top: 24px;">
            <strong>BRNDNUR Advisory LLP</strong><br />
            Manjeri, Malappuram District, Kerala, India &ndash; PIN 676121<br />
            Email: <a href="mailto:brndnuradvisoryllp@gmail.com">brndnuradvisoryllp@gmail.com</a><br />
            Phone / WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+919048188899">+91 90481 88899</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
